abstract: >-
  Protocol, preregistration draft, codebook and reproducible pipeline of the
  REPRO2IMPACT study (Universidad Carlos III de Madrid): a stratified cohort of
  articles in Psychology, Communication and Computational social science
  (2016-2020) in which data, code, preregistration and materials sharing are
  reported as a profile of separate indicators, with their association with
  academic and social impact and a staggered difference-in-differences
  analysis of journal policies. Code under MIT; data and documentation under
  CC BY 4.0.
